life had an effect on you?

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.781
Or you or your grandparents
did a good job of-

00:04:57.781 --> 00:05:00.383
- [Bob] I think my grandparents
did a very good job

00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:02.880
