00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:03.910
- [Interviewer] It's great
that they were there for you.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:04.743
- [Bob] Yeah.

00:05:07.544 --> 00:05:08.377
- [Interviewer] And what do you think

00:05:08.377 --> 00:05:09.429
of this life here in the Tenderloin where-

00:05:09.429 --> 00:05:10.762
- [Bob] It sucks.

00:05:10.762 --> 00:05:12.026
- [Interviewer] Where
drugs are so prevalent.

00:05:12.026 --> 00:05:15.062
- [Bob] Yeah, it just sucks.

00:05:15.062 --> 00:05:16.312
It's just evil.

00:05:18.303 --> 00:05:19.136
