00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.630
Because it destroys so many lives.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.463
- [Bob] Oh God.

00:05:29.482 --> 00:05:31.011
I don't know.

00:05:31.011 --> 00:05:33.570
'Cause I can't say anything
about anybody else,

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.053
because I'm a fucking junkie.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.900
No, I can't say anything about anybody.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.810
How you're gonna fix
it, or how you would...

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.603
Honestly, that's a fact.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.465
That's why I stay pretty much to myself.

00:05:46.465 --> 00:05:47.590
- [Interviewer] Right.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.890
- [Bob] Because I can't...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.183
No.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.013
