- Yeah.

00:06:02.859 --> 00:06:05.109
Little Marlo. He all right.

00:06:06.122 --> 00:06:06.955
But,

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:14.130
I got him by way of his real
owner ODed on drugs, and

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.210
that's the fentanyl.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.700
