yeah. That's common.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:22.987
And what is your drug? Heroin?

00:06:22.987 --> 00:06:25.060
- Heroin.
- Heroin, yeah.

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:28.310
Heroin seems to be popular
here in the Tenderloin, right?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:31.442
- Well, that's because of the fentanyl.

00:06:31.442 --> 00:06:33.900
Everybody knows it's evil.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.873
A lot of guys still do it, though.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.170
My old school, no heroin.
I'm happy with it.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:47.000
