doing it, it would kill me.

00:06:55.554 --> 00:06:56.911
You know what I mean?

00:06:56.911 --> 00:06:57.994
It'd get you.

00:06:59.498 --> 00:07:02.454
I'd nod off somewhere and VC or the NDA

00:07:02.454 --> 00:07:04.480
