00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.973
So that's why I didn't mess with it.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:09.843
And,

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.863
then about three years ago, I started.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.063
Again.

00:07:18.063 --> 00:07:19.500
- Oh, just recently?
- Yeah.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:24.833
Yeah.

