00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:43.763
No.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.083
No.

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:47.383
- [Interviewer] It changed
the man's life forever, right?

00:07:47.383 --> 00:07:49.212
- Oh, definitely.

00:07:49.212 --> 00:07:50.129
Definitely.

00:07:52.697 --> 00:07:53.530
Yeah.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:57.443
Yeah.

00:08:01.097 --> 00:08:02.000
