they make you stronger?

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:46.793
- Yeah. I do believe that, yeah.

00:08:50.227 --> 00:08:51.060
Yeah.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:57.540
Yeah, I pretty much...

