00:09:08.059 --> 00:09:08.892
- [Interviewer] You don't bother anybody.

00:09:08.892 --> 00:09:09.725
They don't bother you.

00:09:09.725 --> 00:09:10.558
- No.

00:09:14.433 --> 00:09:17.760
